WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Preview of the completed interaction.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:02.575
The complete interaction follows.

00:00:02.575 --> 00:00:05.913
Run an order question through the server-owned router.

00:00:05.913 --> 00:00:07.541
The order handler returns fixed public example data.

00:00:07.541 --> 00:00:10.664
Ask about returns. The server selects its other read-only handler.

00:00:10.664 --> 00:00:15.633
The application-owned returns policy appears.
